Yes. Moreover, enchant weapon is one of the most common scrolls, with
enchant armor not far behind.

I never write enchant armor or enchant weapon scrolls if I have at
least 20 "junk" scrolls and a wand of polymorph. With a fully charged
wand, you can expect approximately 1/5 of the scrolls you polypile to
become enchant armor, and around 1/4 to become enchant weapon. Enchant
weapon, in particular, is an extremely expensive scroll to write and
an easy scroll to polypile.

Take Funcrunch's advice: four scrolls per pile, blessed. If you add
more to a pile you double the risk of system shock.


